<!--Post: 880--><!--Time: 1093316263-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST880"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->MMEAD61<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, August 23, 2004 - 7:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Old man, <BR>I  dont know you..No person does..And even though you know you better than anyone else..even you cannot completely see you ..it is only slighty sad..you are complex..you are human..you know your weakness..very bright,sad,and yet you know how trivial and childish you can be... <BR>yes i can see an outline of you but so much i cannot. <BR>do i want you to be caught?... <BR>yes..and no.. <BR>what a story if you were never caught. <BR>But what a story if you were... <BR>sometimes you think about helping others. <BR>I have been so close to being in your place. <BR>But as terrified as i am,it is the fear that keeps me in line.like cattle. <BR>has always kept me in line except for much more minor bad deeds.. <BR>Your &#34;deeds&#34; cross the line to the left and i make every effort for my current &#34;deeds&#34; to move to the right hoping for, desperately hoping for <BR>the good and satisfying outcome.. trying to make up for the past. <BR>and you have done the same. <BR>Are you even who you say you are or someone who is playing a game that has discovered your secret after your death? <BR>Who knows for sure? <BR>My best guess? You Are The Real Deal.... <BR>You have an energy inside you that could have manifested in so many ways..circumstances? <BR>society?.NO..you know and i know you made the choice. <BR>the choice.         the choice. <BR>what is left to say? <BR> <BR>the &#34;experts&#34;,the scholars,parents,friends with good intentions.....all repeat.....Life is all about Choices..........maybe so.......We  <BR>                                 DO <BR>                                 Still <BR>                               make whatever choice we wish. <BR>Amazing how we can turn a perverted wish/thought <BR>into Reality..if we want to. <BR>and never get caught..  if we dont want to.. <BR>but as you know we can also be helpful. <BR> <BR>You have been helpful. <BR>For many years you were as you are still. <BR>But the temptation now is growing. <BR> In the end in retrospect...it will be seen as a choice.You Made.. <BR>The younger you wants the games to begin anew but without the danger and fear and planning and presence of mind to plot and plan and have the bad fun..and you know this is pure childlike fantasy ...the stage has been set and you cannot make the past more exciting than it was without new action... <BR>and you are not up to new action. <BR>and you dont even want new action.... <BR>you want the excitement of the past with a taunt to try to build it.. <BR>it wont be long before you are a national Joke... <BR> <BR>choices.. <BR>the ball always was and still is in your court.. <BR>...you are wise in so many ways.. <BR>will we only discover your message upon a landlord cleaning out your place or a distant relative finding something odd or maybe you will just vanish..??? <BR>what a legacy that will be ..sad... <BR>that is exactly where you are heading. <BR> <BR>your story is just a story to me but to you it is your life and as you know that life will stop and as you know that story will be told.It absolutely Will be told. <BR>Who will tell it? Who will be The One to tell Your story  ?? it absolutely really will  be told someday but by what mindless local newscaster?     <BR>i wish you would. <BR> <BR>I wish you would. <BR> <BR>one thing we all can do...Yes even you...... is absolutely be the author of the last chapter..... <BR> <BR>be the author of the last chapter.. <BR>it is a choice <BR>to do nothing is pure cowardice. <BR> <BR>cowardice=btk     i think not <BR> <BR>dont want to do what i suggest or what anyone else suggests?  fine  <BR>even now you really are writing the last chapters. <BR>btk=  ?? <BR> <BR> <BR>btk =  ? <BR> <BR>you started this saga. <BR>i do wish you well. <BR>i just want you to finish in standup fashion.. <BR>     <BR>you have never been alone. <BR> <BR>MMEAD61 <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
