<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST893"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, August 24, 2004 - 7:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK: We are waiting. Describe the perfect victim as you perceive her to be. In the ultimate fantasy, tell of the encounter and what that victim has that has drawn you to her. How does she fulfill your dreams of good and evil. <BR> <BR>If I am pleased with your answer, I have a poem for you.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
