<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST938"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, August 28, 2004 - 6:30 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->And &#34;Wednesday&#39;s child is full of Woe&#34;. BTK, were you born on Wednesday? I was. There are generational curses that come down the family line. They come in all forms, don&#39;t they? It is at times like being unable to get out of the movie theater. We watch in horror and disbelief. Can anyone look in the mirror and then turn away, forgetting his own face? <BR> <BR>Did you kill as a child? I knew a special ed child who attempted his first murder at 2 1/2 years of age. He continued to try to hurt people after that. <BR> <BR>BTK, are you 10 years or so younger than people think that you are? Sophistication usually come with experience and age, but not always. <BR> <BR>ACL, do you know?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
