<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1016"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Will_graham<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Will_graham<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->9-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, September 10, 2004 - 7:08 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK you are once again in control. You have us just sitting here waiting to see your next move. We are all just watching, waiting for your next move. Your are a very intellegent man who is in control of this game you play. The only way we will ever be enlightened is when YOU decide to give us this knowledge. So we shall just sit and wait for this great riddle that is BTK to unfold as you let it happen.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
