<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1053"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, September 22, 2004 - 7:39 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;Vampire of mine own heart; meanwhile a derelict. I am of those doomed to eternal laughter&#39;s throes, yet powerless to frame a smile.&#34; <BR> <BR>BTK, do you like Baudelaire&#39;s &#39;Flowers of Evil&#39;?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
