</a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, September 26, 2004 - 6:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK, Zodiac <BR>Where are you two? <BR>We haven&#39;t a clue, <BR>Please put out your due, <BR>No more mystery, <BR>No more loo, <BR>Please put a message on your sites, <BR>So we have something to do.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
