<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1113"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Y<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, October 07, 2004 - 1:32 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK: <BR>I hope you are reading all of these threads because you really should be. Congratz! You have people all over the country and maybe the world speculating. People are actually analyzing numerological values of characters in &#34;The Exorcist&#34;.  Some of the posts tying you to the zodiac are pretty accurate &#40;I know you like him&#41; and others are mind boggling reaches.  Regardless of the validity, it&#39;s all about you.  Thats the way you want it, isn&#39;t it?   <BR>  We get old and we get tired.  I&#39;m not a young man and neither are you.  I don&#39;t dance on bars and take strange women home anymore and you don&#39;t lurk in people&#39;s houses and kill them anymore.  But we relive our glory days by talking about them.  I can amuse my friends with my bawdy stories from the &#39;80s and you can taunt the police/media with yours.  Have fun, dude - just don&#39;t hurt anybody else.  While you&#39;re at it can you leave something behind so we can know who you are when it&#39;s all over?  We&#39;re just dying to know &#40;no pun intended&#41; <BR> <BR>By the way, my IP address is a matter of national security and I&#39;ve used every Starbucks on the planet and even a few others, so contact me by driving cross-country with a rag tied to your car antenna.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1113-->
<!--Post: 1127--><!--Time: 1097289456-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1127"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Quell<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Quell<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, October 08, 2004 - 7:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->TO BTK:  A new spin on all of your, and the Zodiac&#39;s endeavors.  This poster right here can safely say that you people haven&#39;t a clue as to exactly what you have ever done, or what you ARE doing, or as to what you are GOING to do. <BR> <BR>For what it is worth, believe it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
