<!--Post: 1133--><!--Time: 1097349742-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1133"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->DP dpinva@hotmail.com<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, October 09, 2004 - 12:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK, if you are reading this, I want to help everyone invloved.  <BR>I am an ordained minister of a mainline church and a qualified counselor. I would like to help you and help society. You said in one of your letters that you were sorry society has been harmed by your factor &#34;X&#34; and you wish you could understand yourself and could quit.  <BR>I am willing to help and have some legally protected ability to talk to you privately. If you want to talk about this or simply get something off your chest, drop me a note at my email or on this Board. Pastor/petinent confidentiality applies here as well as in person and I will do my best to respect that. You really need help and I am offering to do what I can to help you confront the reality of your life and help you communicate whatever you are trying to tell us. Trust has to begin somewhere. Why not here and now? You can trust me to listen to you without judgement or condemnation.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1133-->
<!--Post: 1156--><!--Time: 1097462852-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1156"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Garry<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, October 10, 2004 - 7:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK You are just a wimp. Not enough guts to let us all know you are even alive. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
