n a sense it&#39;s ALOT like how Jack the Ripper was when he contacted Scotland Yard and the newspapers in London...- you probably think that you&#39;re so damn clever...and that the police will NEVER catch you! - Well, I hope to God that they do! And, I hope you get what you SO richly deserve.  <BR>You truly ARE beneath Contempt!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
