<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1573"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:rowdy_beagle@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Star_Gazer<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 03, 2004 - 2:51 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Mr. BTK, I was wondering if you have been giving us clues that your name is S. Snow.  After reading this part of your letter from 1974 &amp; looking at the picture of the baby it appears to me that is what you are trying to tell us.  I will explain below how I came up with this. <BR> <BR>&#34;I write this letter to you for the sake of the tax payer as well as your time. Those three dude&#40;S&#41; you have in custody are just talking to get publicity for the Otero murders. They know nothing at all. I did it by myself and with no ones help. There has been no talk either. Let&#39;s put this straight... .&#34; <BR>&#34;I&#39;m sorry this happen to society. They are the ones who suffer the most. It &#40;IS&#41; hard to control myself. You probably call me &#40;A&#41; &#39;psychotic with sexual perversion hang-up&#40;S&#41;.&#39; When this monster enter&#40;S&#41; my brain I will never know. But, it &#40;IS&#41; here to stay. How does one cure himself? If you ask for help, that you have killed four people they will laugh or hit the panic button and call the cops. <BR>&#34;I can&#39;t stop it so the monster goes on, and &#40;IT&#41; hurt&#40;S&#41; me as well as society. Society can be thankful that there are ways for people like me to relieve myself at time&#40;S&#41; by day dreams of some victims being torture&#40;D&#41; and being mine. It &#40;IS&#41; a big comp&#40;L&#41;icated game my friend of the monster play putting victims number&#40;S&#41; down, follow them, checking up on them waiting in the dark, waiting, waiting... the pressure is great and sometimes he run&#40;S&#41; the game to his liking. Maybe you can stop him. I can&#39;t. He has aready chosen his next victim or victims. I don&#39;t &#40;KNOW&#41; who they are yet. The next day after I read the paper, I will know, but it &#40;IS&#41; to late. Good luck hunting. <BR>&#34;YOURS, TRULY GUILT&#40;IL&#41;Y&#34; <BR> <BR>If I put all the letters or words together in the order that you have it this is what I see that has been left out or misspelled: <BR>&#40;S is a S&#41;, &#40;S is it&#41;, &#40;SS&#41;---Here you are saying that SS is the initials of your name. <BR> <BR>&#40;D is L&#41;---Here you are saying that the extra L in the word Guilty should be replaced with the letter D....now if you put these 2 extra letters together you have ID not IL <BR> <BR>&#40;S Sknow is ID&#41;---if you take the word Know with the letter S in front of it it sounds just like Snow. <BR> <BR>Now...if I put it all together here is what I get:  S is a S.  S is it. &#40;SS&#41;  D is L.  S Sknow is ID. <BR> <BR>When I look at the baby picture....I notice what appears to me to look like a Big S that stands out among all the other letters.  It also looks like a part of the line of the S goes down and connects to the nose of whatever kind of animal that is on the sweater. <BR> <BR>When you take the letter S and put it with the word nose you get Snose which sounds just like Snows...or maybe you could even take what looks like the letter W under the nose and make the word Snow.  And since the letter S is much bigger...I take that it is suppose to represent your 1st initial and your last name. <BR> <BR>When I went here:  <a href="http://www.ussearch.com/search/start.cgi?adID=8010003050&amp;OVRAW=find%20person&amp;OVKEY=find%20a%20person&amp;OVMTC=content" target=_top>http://www.ussearch.com/search/start.cgi?adID=8010 003050&amp;OVRAW=find%20person&amp;OVKEY=find%20a%20person &amp;OVMTC=content</a> <BR>I found quite a few listings for people with the first initial of S. &amp; the last name of Snow in Kansas. There was one person even listed as living in Wichita. <BR> <BR>Could this be you??? <BR>You know, you could make everything easier for everybody else and yourself if you would just be a REAL MAN for once &amp; turn yourself in.  I guess you like the idea of everybody trying to figure out who you are. <BR>GROW UP!!!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
