<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1576"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve Traven<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 03, 2004 - 7:06 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->To BTK: <BR>Anyone who says you are not a brilliant mind is foolish.  I do enjoy reading all of the &#34;expert&#34; analysis of you, and I find it funny when amatuers try to understand your mind or get inside your head. I do not think anyone can understand or appreciate your intellect, and with that said, do you really want to die and have the only material available to people to learn about you be false, textbook descriptions of you?  Is it worth all the years of work that you have done to remain so mysterious to go down in the history books as a typical psycho, who must have been lonely, shy, self-absorved, etc. etc..Wouldn&#39;t it be better for your legacy to prove everyone wrong, you have done so thus far, so why settle as being a typical serial killer when you can go down as one whom was &#34;special&#34;, who was smarter than the FBI, all the investigators, and detectives, all the one who speculate about you...until you surface, turn yourself in before they catch you and tell your story, you will always be casted as typical, and when you are caught you will lose, and you will have been finally outsmarted, and that is what people will remember.  Your letters in present day do nothing but tell us that you are old and weak and do not have the strenght to kill, and can only terrorize through the thought of you killing again.  You are done, so finish it, surface and tell us why no one could catch you.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
