eat SOMTHING... well knowing it was evil that was going to be the tool to feel? <BR>  <BR>BTK...I feel for you genuine...I know about this myself, I have a brother, I have a son who was a child like you, they never becan´me like you, but they could have, if they had not been showered in love and understanding... but still what you have done is NOT right, you are a hostage of evil...I wish I could help you but i don´t think i can, the only thing I can do is to send you this message to tell you I understand WHY!... <BR>  <BR>I pray and pray and pray to that you realize what you have done, that you deside within the child of you soul, to wholehearted apologize to the victimes and their families and ask for forgivness...doing that you will be able to connect to the beautifull innocent soul of a child,that you once were, the soul that you were born with and that the people around you never saw and never gave love... <BR>  <BR>...only loving hands should carry mirrors... <BR>  <BR>BTK...please let love enter... <BR>  <BR>Love and hugs...skov <!--/Text--></td></tr>
