39;t know, we brainstorm. You decide how you want the interview to end. I am dramtically opposed to the interview ending with you trying to strangle me...I&#39;ll give you 5 minutes to jerk off now...come back and finish reading my post when your done. It might be funny if I asked you something personal and you broke out some chord. <BR>See, as a serial killer you can take it to a another level...change the game, if you will. You have failed to this point in your manipulation of the media which is why you have never really elevated yourself and to some you are 3rd rate. You can write the best songs in the world but if you have no promotion you might as well ask if they want fries with that. Know what I&#39;m saying chico? <!--/Text--></td></tr>
