<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1748"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Castle Sander<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 9:50 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK, I, in no way, endorse your actions, but on the other hand sir, you won&#39;t hear any sort of name-calling arrogance from me. It&#39;s not that I&#39;m even indifferent to your behavoir sir, your actions have been henious, this you apparently have acknowledged on your own time. But I don&#39;t believe the name-calling here is beneficial, it&#39;s at best counter-productive. We all want to hear more from you sir. BTK, I&#39;ve composed this piece of poetry.......... Give me a B. Gimme a T. And alast a K. Bind,Torture,Kill, is that how you say it? Or is it morer truly BKT? Could that be? A hidden denial. From a necrophile? Only a guess? Yes. But what of these photos of death? Oh, what a mess. Skipping down Arrowhead with a camera and headdress. Better To Know. Let&#39;s all hope that&#39;s the acroname now.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
