<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1834"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->mcattitude<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, December 13, 2004 - 5:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK are you jealous of the attention that Scott Peterson has gotten the last few years??? He was just given the death penalty by a jury today. Now there will be books about him by jurors by his girlfriend. Already been one movie about him.  <BR> <BR> <BR>Don&#39;t ya want books and movies made about ya BTK??? <BR> <BR> <BR>Ya know Ed Gein he was the king of weirdness no one has outdone Ed in what he did. He had lots of movies based on him. Don&#39;t ya want that publicity BTK like Ed Gein???? You know ya get alot of publiblity when you are doing the killings but I think serial killer have even more publicity when they are caught when it is known who they are. I mean yeah if they bring in someone they think is you it will make CNN and the national news for a little bit. But if you want to capture the nations attention leave them know who you are. Give them a name. That doesn&#39;t mean they will find ya right away. Or if ya really want attention allow them to catch ya. You are gettin old now don&#39;t you want to be able to hear about what they will say about you??? Don&#39;t you want to know that they are making a movie about ya or writing books about ya. Something tells me that your story while not as weird as Ed&#39;s would be better then alot of the serial killers. You don&#39;t want that to come after you are dead do ya??? I would think you would want to know about it. I mean come on you say you have no control over it while that may be true in part you do have the control over whether they find you or not. Aren&#39;t you in a prison somehow right now because of when the &#34;monster&#34; takes over??? If you were in prison they could give ya medicine to control the monster.   <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR>BTK we want to know who are we want to learn about you we want to know the why&#39;s , what&#39;s. we want to try to understand you. <BR> <BR> <BR>we want to hear from you again.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
