<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1848"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Know who you Are<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 14, 2004 - 12:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK: I believe that you are related to a very well known family in Wichita. Susan, the cousin that moved to Mo. moved back didn&#39;t she? She&#39;s married to Chris! I also believe that the WPD asked you for a DNA sample and you said no, with lawyers in tow. Its too much for you to come forword for your family isn&#39;t it? What it would do to a well known family in city goverment to be related to the famous BTK would end lives work wouldn&#39;t it? This is why you won&#39;t say anymore than you have. You want so bad to be caught and end this hell you are going thru and get your day in the sun but yet you don&#39;t want to take your own family down at the same time. So it has to be a big riddle, a puzzle with answers that can be no answer at all. And when someone gets to that answer, they must be stopped, at all costs? Do you know what the cost was to him? I do!!! And all he was trying to do is keep another unknown person from living the hell that the last suspect went thru at your expence. And now he is paying the price. I know about the bricks, the P.J.Wyatt connection, Petra and Tina, all of it!!! If we come to the answers how long do you really think it will before someone elce does??? You give out all the clues, then hide when its figured out. You make no sence. Make up your mind, answer people or go away for good!! This isn&#39;t a joke anymore, more people are getting hurt all over again. And IT WILL STOP!!!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
