<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1967"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sedan Delivery<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, December 16, 2004 - 4:15 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It is inescapable that you have been assessed by the preponderance of numbers of the living as being an exemplary figure of the epitome of cowardice in human form.  My personal assessment is that your actions were controlled by a force over which you at several times, for whatever reasons, were unable to contain.  It might have been the same result for many other people, possessed of the spirit which overcame you, and you just happened to be an unfortunate one whom the negative energy was able to permeate and control in that time frame.  You are not weak, but alas, only human, and formerly susceptible to those forces which controlled you.  But, in your defense, I think it can be said that the portions of good which reside within you were able to successfully overcome the negative energy for quite some time, and I can only imagine the tough struggles you must have faced, with their attendant great pain.  Perhaps you deserve commendation, even though few other humans are capable of this realisation.  <BR> <BR>I realise that your victims energies likely continue to haunt you, in visions and moments of vertigo, etc.  This is evidence that they have likely banded together in the afterlife and lie in wait with their gained experience with regards to how to deal with spirits who freshly come over, respecting revenge, etc.  This is an inescapable fact.  Right now, their spirits and a number of other spirits surviving on the other side will soon have an opportunity to judge, pronounce, and carry out an eternal sentence upon you, provided the Almighty doesn&#39;t override their action.    <BR> <BR>I see at this point that there are no manspirits with any ammunition to stand and speak in your defence for your actions.  I see that it can be said that you were able to successfully contain the negative energy for quite some time, which is something to be said in your favor.  But, before it is all over, while there is still time, I personally think you should consider an appropriate means of removing the cowardice label sewn to your soul, for by it you would otherwise be judged.  By coming forward, and acting as a true MAN, and reconciling the matter before the current living, your soul will stand some chance of being spared from the final sentence that would otherwise be sealed to It, from those few actions in a few brief moments in this short life.  There is still time left.  Our God is forgiving, by His own definitions, and the evidence in this world of His greatness should be enough to convince you that He wants you to do the right thing towards shedding that cowardice moniker, and act like a MAN, so that you may gain a measure of mercy in the eternity you soon face.  It is not too late. <BR> <BR>Things start looking good once you sink your teeth into the notion that He understands you, whereas the vast majority of humans are incapable of doing same.  And it is to Him that you must now latch onto, notwithstanding the opinions of any Men.  Yes, there will be many who jeer at you, and it might be big in the news for a short while, but that time frame is dwarfed in reference to eternity.  You absolutely must do this now, while you still have the power within you to do so.   It will take courage, and it undoubtedly comes  as no surprise to you that the Grand Architect of the Universe has put that courage in you, recently.  I know this for a fact because He is my Father, and He has told me so, which is why I was compelled to take time out of my very very very busy day to convey this message of hope to you, an unknown stranger in life, but a human energy soul nevertheless.  He is counting on you to do the Right thing in the end. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1967-->
