<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1988"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:x3maine@spymac.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->X3<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, December 16, 2004 - 1:24 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK, I assume you do not have much longer to live. Your glory days of murder and terror are long behind you. Death creeps slowly towards you now, but you know it will soon sprint for you. Impending acceleration towards death is why you now stir the embers of your once fearful reign of horror. <BR> <BR>This is not a plea for you to turn yourself in. You will never turn yourself in. Nor is it a plea for you to leave a note upon your death explaining your deeds. You will never explain anything. It is what it is. <BR> <BR>BTK, it is obvious that you miss the feeling of power you had back when you were killing innocent people. About that power: your crimes aren&#39;t that important. They did not change society, nor the world, and mean absolutely nothing in the grand scheme of things. I do of course feel sorrow for the victims and those who knew and loved them. But ultimately, you accomplished nothing in your crimes. <BR> <BR>Your lack of accomplishment, subsequent slide into obscurity, and coming death is why you choose now to resurrect your games. You know the human mind despises an unsolved mystery.  BTK, that is why you are now giving out &#34;clues&#34; to deepen the mystery of who you are, and of the things you have done. <BR> <BR>Too bad all the info you release is fake and/or misleading. You have released identifying objects such as a victim&#39;s driver license to prove you are BTK. You need to do so to accomplish your goal. However, you are not releasing any true or tangible clue as to who BTK actually is. Your clues as to who you really are are smokescreens, dead ends. BTK, don&#39;t get an erection thinking about how you are tricking everyone, making them pay attention to you, unsettling their minds with the mystery of who you are. It really is no big deal. You are interesting to read about, but are nothing more than that. <BR> <BR>BTK, you watch movies or read books. Does it bug you when a book or movie doesn&#39;t give a satisfying ending?  It does, as it leaves one with a feeling of incompleteness. That is exactly what you are trying to do: arouse interest, and then die without providing answers, thus leaving people with an irreversible feeling of incompleteness and curiosity. Big bad BTK is going to depart the world at the height of his newfound &#34;popularity&#34;, in the spotlight once again, but when he is found dead, there will be no answers. Only mystery.  Well, BTK, your life, just like a book or a movie without a satisfying ending, will be remembered only for moments, just as a reader or viewer is only annoyed by an incomplete ending for a short while. In the end, life moves on. People WILL forget about you. <BR> <BR>But thanks anyway, BKT, for allowing us to enjoy this real-life mystery for now. Unfortunately, like finding out how a movie ends before you even see it, we already know the ending to the BTK story. You are a living example of a bad Hollywood script: predictable and shallow, with no regard for character development. Adios, BKT! Have a peaceful death. <BR> <BR>More for you to read in the next post, BTK. I couldn&#39;t fit it all in one post, no matter how much I edited my message.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
